[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 542.87, "timestamp": "00:09:02", "text": "。 你就是没法去睡觉。 呃，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 546.23, "timestamp": "00:09:06", "text": "不能就这么睡过去。   嗯，对，就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 550.949, "timestamp": "00:09:10", "text": "那个东西，我指的就是它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 554.87, "timestamp": "00:09:14", "text": "不多，抱歉，我的错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 558.55, "timestamp": "00:09:18", "text": "我通常的做法就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 560.71, "timestamp": "00:09:20", "text": "看看直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 562.23, "timestamp": "00:09:22", "text": "或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 564.47, "timestamp": "00:09:24", "text": "听听ASMR之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 566.31, "timestamp": "00:09:26", "text": "东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 569.829, "timestamp": "00:09:29", "text": "听听助眠音乐，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 573.67, "timestamp": "00:09:33", "text": "你知道那种低保真音乐，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 578.389, "timestamp": "00:09:38", "text": "慢慢地就睡着了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 585.91, "timestamp": "00:09:45", "text": "嗯，我觉得就像只要你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 587.829, "timestamp": "00:09:47", "text": "的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 592.07, "timestamp": "00:09:52", "text": "身体感到疲惫，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 594.63, "timestamp": "00:09:54", "text": "的大脑就会说，是的，他的身体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 599.59, "timestamp": "00:09:59", "text": "累了，所以该休息了。"}]